
Getal leer: ['plus:'] betekent: ['+'].
Getal bij: ['+'] doen: { :x
	>> rate := 1.
	>> currency := x kwalificering.
	(currency = ['euros']) ja: {
		rate := 2.
	}. <- (zelf plus: (x × rate)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars kwalificering: ['dollars'].
euros kwalificering: ['euros'].
>> money := dollars + euros.
Uit schrijf: money, stop.
